.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;52&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-70</span>: On the ground next to Xargrim the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Xargrim\" title=\"Xargrim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/25px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/38px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/50px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pale Corpse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png/25px-Portrait_Xargrim.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Portrait_Xargrim.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Xargrim\" title=\"Xargrim\">Pale Corpse</a>, in the secret area unlocked by completing the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defeat_the_Duergar_Intruders\" title=\"Defeat the Duergar Intruders\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defeat the Duergar Intruders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Defeat_the_Duergar_Intruders\" title=\"Defeat the Duergar Intruders\">Defeat the Duergar Intruders</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In D&amp;D lore, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Menzoberranzan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Menzoberranzan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Menzoberranzan\">Menzoberranzan</a></span> is an underground city built into a cavern in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, largely populated by <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> and known for complex political intrigues.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shadow_of_Menzoberranzan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nor